fixture hazard_respawn_drops_stale_dash
doc docs/adr/0010, hazards (movement review 4, M2): hazard_respawn_drops_stale_jump with the dash. The air dash is spent over the pit (frame 31) and a dash pressed again on frame 58, before the hazard, waits in its buffer; the send-back uses it up, so no dash fires from the respawn point. (It used to fire as a ground dash toward the edge the tick after the send-back.)
room test/spike_chasm
spawn 300 384
frames 120
input
  0..30 R
  31 R dash
  32..57 R
  58 R dash
  59..119 R
end
expect
  at 31 event.dash=1
  mark die 32..90 event.hazard=1
  never die+1..die+10 event.dash=1
end
